.TH SH 1 "2024-05-12" "1.0" "CSE 3200 Shell Manual"
.SH NAME
sh \- Custom Python-based Unix Shell
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
A custom shell built for CSE 3200. Supports basic command execution, PATH resolution, pseudo-terminal I/O, and basic background job tracking.
.SH BUILTINS
.TP
.B cd [dir]
Changes the current working directory.
.TP
.B pwd
Prints the working directory.
.TP
.B type [cmd]
Displays how a command would be interpreted (builtin or PATH).
.TP
.B exit
Exits the shell.
.SH EXAMPLES
Run a command in the background:
.PP
.RS
sleep 5 &
.RE